        "text_FPtdzV": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Welcome to the World of Mabangó</p><p></p><p>Mabangó is built around this idea that beautiful scents create memories that are everlasting, making your happy place, your rituals of care just a laundry basket away. We create mindfully formulated laundry essentials. Our fragrances are inspired by memories, moments, experiences and feelings- those that are intimately personal and universally shared. But most of al, our fragrances are inspired by the beauty of the Philippines. Hoping it will provide daily pleasures as you wash your favourites making your rituals of care, just a laundry basket away.</p>"
          }
        }
